-- Re-sync script: safely re-imports the Payment Follow-Up spreadsheet data.
-- For each spreadsheet row, it deletes any existing record with the SAME
-- branch + company name + entry date (an old/incorrect copy, if present)
-- and inserts the correct one - so it's always safe to run again after
-- updating the spreadsheet, and it won't create duplicates.
-- It will NOT touch records for a different company/date that you've
-- added manually through the app.

